nts needed to verify a time-respecting sequence with <=600 delays, so temporal ordering sufficient to confirm a cascade cannot be established from these results.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 42285, "total_output_tokens": 6192, "total_tokens": 48477, "total_latency_ms": 77298, "llm_calls": 10, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}